# Unit tests for alarm.c. Expected outputs were derived by hand from the
# behaviour documented at the top of alarm.c, not recorded from the program.
#
### high-delay-boundary detect
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=30 escalate=0
init 100
s 100 31
tick 129
tick 130
---
cfg
NORMAL
NORMAL
NORMAL
HIGH TO_HIGH@130:31.000

