### return-condition-is-continuous-across-zones detect
# From HIGH the value drops into the normal band at 40 and below low at 60.
# "value < high - deadband" has held since 40, so NORMAL at 70; LOW at 90.
cfg high=30 low=10 deadband=2 delay=30 escalate=0
init 0
s 0 35
s 30 35
s 40 20
s 60 5
s 70 5
s 89 5
s 90 5
---
cfg
NORMAL
NORMAL
HIGH TO_HIGH@30:35.000
HIGH
HIGH
NORMAL TO_NORMAL@70:5.000
NORMAL
LOW TO_LOW@90:5.000

